# xFacts label vs nutrition metaphor

On product surfaces (README, npm, GitHub, LocalHelm, site chrome, shelf cards) the heading is **xFacts label**. Never "Nutrition label".

Keep "nutrition label" only in teaching copy if the food analogy is being taught.

Write **FeatureFacts** as one word with both capital Fs. Write the family as **xFacts**, lowercase x.
